Spec: Site

Purpose:
  Public GitHub Pages site with the privacy policy and the imprint that the store listings link to.

Owns:
  ./index.html
  ./style.css
  ./privacy/index.html
  ./impressum/index.html

References:
  /docs/play-store.md

Must:
  Privacy policy and imprint exist in German and English and link each other.
  The privacy policy changes in the same change whenever the app starts sending data somewhere new.
  The imprint names the c/o address of the imprint service, never a home address.
  `.github/workflows/pages.yml` publishes only this directory.
